  "description": "Alfa Laval MOPX 209 self-cleaning disc-stack centrifuge. OEM application capacity for diesel at 40 C and 13 cSt is 7,900 L/h (34.78 US GPM derived); gas oil and lube oils have separate values and conditions. 15 HP, 5,180 RPM.",
