    "description": "Dolphin-engineered turnkey module built on a remanufactured Alfa Laval MOPX 209 centrifuge. Dolphin Centrifuge is an independent remanufacturer and is not affiliated with Alfa Laval.",
    "brand": { "@type": "Brand", "name": "Alfa Laval" },
