  description="Alfa Laval MOPX 209 self-cleaning disc stack centrifuge: 15 HP, 5,180 RPM, and exact OEM capacities by fluid and condition, including 7,900 L/h diesel at 40 C and 13 cSt."
  category="products"
  categoryLabel="Products"
  categoryHref="/alfa-laval-centrifuges/"
  heroImage="/images/alfa-laval-mopx-209-centrifuge/Alfa-Laval-MOPX209-Cutting-Oil-Centrifuge-300.webp"
  heroImageAlt="Alfa Laval MOPX209 Cutting Oil Centrifuge"
  canonicalUrl="https://dolphincentrifuge.com/alfa-laval-mopx-209-centrifuge/"
  jsonLd={jsonLd}
  toc={toc}
  relatedApplications={relatedApplications}
  relatedProducts={relatedProducts}
  hideBottomCTA={true}
  disableTitleSuffix={true}
>

  <div class="bg-navy/5 border-l-4 border-gold rounded-r-lg p-4 mb-6 not-prose">
    <p class="text-sm text-text-light leading-relaxed italic">The Alfa Laval MOPX 209 is a self-cleaning disc stack centrifuge with a 15 HP motor at 5,180 RPM. Its OEM application table lists 7,900 L/h (34.78 US GPM derived) for diesel at 40 &deg;C and 13 cSt. Gas oil and lube oils have separate values and conditions; this machine is one exact base option for the Dolphin DMPX-042 module.</p>
  </div>

  <h2 id="overview">MOPX 209 Total-Discharge Centrifuge</h2>

  <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6 items-start mb-6">
    <div class="flex-1">
      <p>
        The Alfa Laval MOPX 209 Centrifuge has a 15 HP motor and a bowl speed of 5,180 RPM. It is a self-cleaning, <a href="/disc-stack-centrifuge/">disc stack centrifuge</a> designed for continuous three-phase separation of fuels and mineral oils. The OEM values below apply only to the named fluids and listed conditions; <a href="/biodiesel-centrifuge/">biodiesel</a>, <a href="/waste-oil-centrifuge/">waste oil</a>, and other duties require application-specific sizing.
      </p>
      <p>
        Alfa Laval MOPX 209 Centrifuge for Large Scale Processing of Aluminum Drawing Oil.
      </p>
      <p>
        Dolphin Centrifuge is the independent specialist in <a href="/alfa-laval-centrifuges/">Alfa Laval</a> centrifuges. Apart from Alfa Laval itself, Dolphin is the reliable source for quality Alfa Laval machines: remanufactured MOPX 209, WHPX 409, and MAPX 309 centrifuges, turnkey systems, parts, and service, built on 40+ years of Alfa Laval experience and led by Sanjay Prabhu, M.S.M.E. Every machine on this page is a genuine Alfa Laval, stripped, rebuilt, balanced, and tested in Dolphin's Warren, Michigan shop. Dolphin is an independent remanufacturer and is not affiliated with Alfa Laval.
      </p>
      <p>
        The MOPX 209 ships either as a bare remanufactured centrifuge or inside the Dolphin <a href="/centrifuges/dmpx-042/">DMPX-042 module</a>, a Dolphin-engineered turnkey skid featuring a remanufactured Alfa Laval MOPX 209. The module frame, heaters, pump, piping, and PLC controls are Dolphin's engineering; the centrifuge at the heart of it is Alfa Laval.
      </p>
    </div>
    <img
      src="/images/alfa-laval-mopx-209-centrifuge/Alfa-Laval-MOPX209-Cutting-Oil-Centrifuge-300.webp"
      alt="Alfa Laval MOPX209 Cutting Oil Centrifuge"
      width="300"
      height="346"
      loading="lazy"
      class="rounded-lg img-cap-300 shrink-0"
    />
  </div>

  <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Capacities retain the published L/h values; US GPM is derived using L/h &divide; 227.124707 and shown to two decimal places. See the <a href="/technical-data/">authoritative technical-data registry</a>.</p>

  <blockquote>
    Dolphin Centrifuge supplies a range of self-cleaning fuel purifiers for diesel, heavy fuel, and waste oils &mdash; available as complete modules with pre-heaters, starters, and PLC control panels. <a href="/contact-for-alfa-laval-centrifuges/">Request a quote</a>.
  </blockquote>

  <h2 id="specifications">MOPX 209 Specifications</h2>

  <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6 items-start mb-6">
    <div class="flex-1">
      <table>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td><strong>Model Type</strong></td><td>Alfa Laval MOPX 209 TGT 20-60</td></tr>
          <tr><td><strong>Gas Oil</strong></td><td>11,800 L/h (51.95 US GPM derived), 40 &deg;C</td></tr>
          <tr><td><strong>Diesel</strong></td><td>7,900 L/h (34.78 US GPM derived), 40 &deg;C, 13 cSt</td></tr>
          <tr><td><strong>R&amp;O / Engine Lube Oil</strong></td><td>4,100 L/h (18.05 US GPM derived), 80&ndash;90 &deg;C</td></tr>
          <tr><td><strong>Steam Turbine Lube Oil</strong></td><td>7,700 L/h (33.90 US GPM derived), 60&ndash;70 &deg;C</td></tr>
          <tr><td><strong>Sludge Space</strong></td><td>2.00 Gallons</td></tr>
          <tr><td><strong>Motor HP</strong></td><td>15 HP</td></tr>
          <tr><td><strong>Voltages</strong></td><td>230 / 460 V</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <img
      src="/images/alfa-laval-mopx-209-centrifuge/Alfa-Laval-MOPX209-Machining-Oil-Centrifuge-e1615147323481.webp"
      alt="Alfa Laval MOPX209 Machining Oil Centrifuge"
      width="250"
      height="250"
      loading="lazy"
      class="rounded-lg img-cap-300 shrink-0"
    />
  </div>

  <h2 id="whpx-409">Alfa Laval WHPX 409 Partial-Discharge Disc-Stack Centrifuge</h2>

  <blockquote>
    <strong>Also, read our <a href="/alfa-laval-centrifuge-selection-guide/">Alfa Laval Centrifuge Selection Guide</a></strong>
  </blockquote>

  <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6 items-start mb-6">
    <img
      src="/images/alfa-laval-mopx-209-centrifuge/Waste-Oil-Centrifuge-Alfa-Laval-MOPX209-e1614023868488.webp"
