          <tr><td><strong>HFO 460 cSt at 50 &deg;C</strong></td><td>2,800 L/h (12.33 US GPM derived), centrifuged at 98 &deg;C</td></tr>
          <tr><td><strong>HFO 600 cSt at 50 &deg;C</strong></td><td>2,300 L/h (10.13 US GPM derived), centrifuged at 98 &deg;C</td></tr>
          <tr><td><strong>Cross-Head R&amp;O Lube Oil</strong></td><td>3,800&ndash;4,400 L/h (16.73&ndash;19.37 US GPM derived), 80&ndash;90 &deg;C</td></tr>
          <tr><td><strong>Cross-Head Detergent Lube Oil</strong></td><td>3,100&ndash;3,800 L/h (13.65&ndash;16.73 US GPM derived), 80&ndash;90 &deg;C</td></tr>
          <tr><td><strong>Trunk Detergent Lube Oil</strong></td><td>2,300&ndash;2,500 L/h (10.13&ndash;11.01 US GPM derived), 80&ndash;90 &deg;C</td></tr>
          <tr><td><strong>Steam Turbine Lube Oil</strong></td><td>8,000 L/h (35.22 US GPM derived), 60&ndash;70 &deg;C</td></tr>
          <tr><td><strong>Sludge Space</strong></td><td>1.30 Gallons</td></tr>
          <tr><td><strong>Motor HP</strong></td><td>12.5 HP</td></tr>
          <tr><td><strong>Voltages</strong></td><td>230 / 460 V</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2 id="mapx-309">Alfa Laval MAPX 309 BGT-14, Full-Discharge, Disc-Stack Centrifuge</h2>

  <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6 items-start mb-6">
    <div class="flex-1">
      <p>
        The Alfa Laval MAPX 309 Centrifuge is a heavy-duty, self-cleaning disc-stack centrifuge used for mineral-oil and fuel duties. Dolphin's current OEM capacity registry does not include a source record for MAPX 309, so no flow value is published here and no MOPX 209 or WHPX 409 value should be transferred to it.
      </p>
      <table>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td><strong>Model Type</strong></td><td>Alfa Laval MAPX 309 BGT-14</td></tr>
